# Telegram bot creds for tooling/cli/notify — copy to telegram.env (gitignored) and fill in.
# 1. Message @BotFather on Telegram, run /newbot, paste the token below.
# 2. Message your new bot once (any text), then run `tooling/cli/notify/notify setup`
#    to auto-fill TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
# Alerts forum group (optional): add the bot as admin with "Manage topics", send a
# message in the group, then run `notify setup-group`. Topic ids are added by notify.
TELEGRAM_GROUP_ID=
